Sinnoh_TwinleafTown_Text_Person1:
	.string "The wind off the lake smells like rain\n"
	.string "today.\p"
	.string "My MOéMON curl up by the fire when it\n"
	.string "does. I think I'll join them.$"

Sinnoh_TwinleafTown_Text_Person2:
	.string "I've lived in TWINLEAF my whole life\n"
	.string "and I still find new rocks by the pond.\p"
	.string "This one's shaped like a STARLY! Well...\n"
	.string "if you squint.$"

Sinnoh_TwinleafTown_Text_Person4:
	.string "North of here is ROUTE 201. The grass\n"
	.string "gets tall fast, so wild MOéMON jump\l"
	.string "out before you know it.\p"
	.string "If you came all the way to SINNOH, you\n"
	.string "can handle that, right?$"

Sinnoh_TwinleafTown_Text_Sign5:
	.string "TWINLEAF TOWN\p"
	.string "Where the wind off the lake starts its\n"
	.string "journey.$"

Sinnoh_TwinleafTown_Text_Sign6:
	.string "It's a mailbox.\p"
	.string "There's a postcard sticking out.\n"
	.string "“Back for dinner. Promise!”$"

Sinnoh_TwinleafTown_Text_Sign7:
	.string "It's a mailbox.\p"
	.string "It's stuffed with flyers for running\n"
	.string "shoes.$"

